{"type":"message","id":"4581b7d7","parentId":"bbc86942","timestamp":"2026-04-19T05:05:26.328Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_d81d8ddf1be946fd9905a5a4","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"nvidia llama-3.2-90b-vision capabilities features 2025\",\n  \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 1015,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6fb88cedec06d1fb\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nVision Capabilities | How-to guides - llama.com\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6fb88cedec06d1fb\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.llama.com/docs/how-to-guides/vision-capabilities/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"536f2612800da7c1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCapabilities of Llama 3.2 The new multimodal models, in 11B and 90B , support image reasoning use cases. Examples are document-level understanding-including charts and graphs, captioning of images, and visual grounding tasks-such as directionally pinpointing objects in images based on natural language descriptions.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"536f2612800da7c1\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.llama.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7dfe858fd2558e1b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nLlama 3.2 Overview — NVIDIA NIM for Vision Language Models (VLMs)\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7dfe858fd2558e1b\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://docs.nvidia.com/nim/vision-language-models/1.2.0/examples/llama3-2/overview.html\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"49dfd199d11e48f7\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nLlama 3.2 Overview # Model Information # The Meta Llama 3.2 Vision collection of multimodal large language models (LLMs) is a collection of pre-trained and instruction-tuned image reasoning generative models in 11B and 90B sizes (text + images in / text out). The Llama 3.2 Vision instruction-tuned models are optimized for visual recognition, image reasoning, captioning, and answering general ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"49dfd199d11e48f7\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"docs.nvidia.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5701279578d985da\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nmeta-llama/Llama-3.2-90B-Vision · Hugging Face\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5701279578d985da\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-3.2-90B-Vision\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4166b92437f8e1e1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWe're on a journey to advance and democratize artificial intelligence through open source and open science.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4166b92437f8e1e1\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"huggingface.co\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"95b92ede078e2c45\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMeta Llama 3.2 90B Vision - docs.oracle.com\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"95b92ede078e2c45\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://docs.oracle.com/en-us/iaas/Content/generative-ai/meta-llama-3-2-90b.htm\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8d7a1f0cc06095ad\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe meta. llama -3.2- 90b - vision -instruct model offers text and image understanding features and is available for on-demand inferencing and dedicated hosting.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8d7a1f0cc06095ad\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"docs.oracle.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"726e8775dce71012\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nLlama 3.2: Revolutionizing edge AI and vision with open, customizable ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"726e8775dce71012\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ai.meta.com/blog/llama-3-2-connect-2024-vision-edge-mobile-devices/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"bea78e6b7c95f2c4\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nToday, we're releasing Llama 3.2 , which includes small and medium-sized vision LLMs, and lightweight, text-only models that fit onto edge and mobile devices.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"bea78e6b7c95f2c4\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ai.meta.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"nvidia llama-3.2-90b-vision capabilities features 2025","provider":"duckduckgo","count":5,"tookMs":1015,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"duckduckgo","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6fb88cedec06d1fb\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nVision Capabilities | How-to guides - llama.com\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6fb88cedec06d1fb\">>>","url":"https://www.llama.com/docs/how-to-guides/vision-capabilities/","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"536f2612800da7c1\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nCapabilities of Llama 3.2 The new multimodal models, in 11B and 90B , support image reasoning use cases. Examples are document-level understanding-including charts and graphs, captioning of images, and visual grounding tasks-such as directionally pinpointing objects in images based on natural language descriptions.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"536f2612800da7c1\">>>","siteName":"www.llama.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7dfe858fd2558e1b\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nLlama 3.2 Overview — NVIDIA NIM for Vision Language Models (VLMs)\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7dfe858fd2558e1b\">>>","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/nim/vision-language-models/1.2.0/examples/llama3-2/overview.html","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"49dfd199d11e48f7\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nLlama 3.2 Overview # Model Information # The Meta Llama 3.2 Vision collection of multimodal large language models (LLMs) is a collection of pre-trained and instruction-tuned image reasoning generative models in 11B and 90B sizes (text + images in / text out). The Llama 3.2 Vision instruction-tuned models are optimized for visual recognition, image reasoning, captioning, and answering general ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"49dfd199d11e48f7\">>>","siteName":"docs.nvidia.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"5701279578d985da\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nmeta-llama/Llama-3.2-90B-Vision · Hugging Face\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"5701279578d985da\">>>","url":"https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-3.2-90B-Vision","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"4166b92437f8e1e1\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nWe're on a journey to advance and democratize artificial intelligence through open source and open science.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"4166b92437f8e1e1\">>>","siteName":"huggingface.co"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"95b92ede078e2c45\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMeta Llama 3.2 90B Vision - docs.oracle.com\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"95b92ede078e2c45\">>>","url":"https://docs.oracle.com/en-us/iaas/Content/generative-ai/meta-llama-3-2-90b.htm","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"8d7a1f0cc06095ad\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe meta. llama -3.2- 90b - vision -instruct model offers text and image understanding features and is available for on-demand inferencing and dedicated hosting.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"8d7a1f0cc06095ad\">>>","siteName":"docs.oracle.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"726e8775dce71012\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nLlama 3.2: Revolutionizing edge AI and vision with open, customizable ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"726e8775dce71012\">>>","url":"https://ai.meta.com/blog/llama-3-2-connect-2024-vision-edge-mobile-devices/","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"bea78e6b7c95f2c4\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nToday, we're releasing Llama 3.2 , which includes small and medium-sized vision LLMs, and lightweight, text-only models that fit onto edge and mobile devices.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"bea78e6b7c95f2c4\">>>","siteName":"ai.meta.com"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776575126326}}
{"type":"message","id":"b1a3fc07","parentId":"4581b7d7","timestamp":"2026-04-19T05:05:26.418Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_4f16f9582da74a03883b3c63","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"nvidia phi-4-multimodal capabilities features 2025\",\n  \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 1107,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f4e7e74875242885\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nphi-4-multimodal-instruct Model by Microsoft | NVIDIA NIM\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f4e7e74875242885\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://build.nvidia.com/microsoft/phi-4-multimodal-instruct/modelcard\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"36eb642518a7f546\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nModel Quality To understand the capabilities , Phi -4- multimodal -instruct was compared with a set of models over a variety of benchmarks using an internal benchmark platform. Users can refer to the Phi-4-Mini model card for details of language benchmarks. Below is a high-level overview of the model quality on representative speech and vision ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"36eb642518a7f546\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"build.nvidia.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f3d59406bb2d9b19\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nPhi-4-Mini Technical Report: Compact yet Powerful Multimodal Language ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f3d59406bb2d9b19\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.01743\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"08389f09b0183206\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWe introduce Phi-4-Mini and Phi-4-Multimodal , compact yet highly capable language and multimodal models. Phi-4-Mini is a 3.8-billion-parameter language model trained on high-quality web and synthetic data, significantly outperforming recent open-source models of similar size and matching the performance of models twice its size on math and coding tasks requiring complex reasoning. This ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"08389f09b0183206\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"arxiv.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"321a0cf670535bf9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWelcome to the new Phi-4 models - Microsoft Phi-4-mini & Phi-4-multimodal\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"321a0cf670535bf9\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/blog/educatordeveloperblog/welcome-to-the-new-phi-4-models---microsoft-phi-4-mini--phi-4-multimodal/4386037\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cebe6212f9949cec\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNow, let's dive into the new Phi-4-mini and Phi-4-multimodal together! Function calling This is a highly anticipated feature within the community. With function calling, Phi-4-mini and Phi-4-multimodal can extend their text-processing capabilities by integrating search engines, connecting various tools, and more.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cebe6212f9949cec\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"techcommunity.microsoft.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dbe2e5b9d529f6e1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nnvidia/Phi-4-multimodal-instruct-FP8 · Hugging Face\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dbe2e5b9d529f6e1\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Phi-4-multimodal-instruct-FP8\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"283b287b5db8f113\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe NVIDIA Phi -4- multimodal -instruct FP8 model is the quantized version of Microsoft's Phi -4- multimodal -instruct model, which is a multimodal foundation model that uses an optimized transformer architecture.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"283b287b5db8f113\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"huggingface.co\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4bcf86a6c669572f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nmicrosoft / phi-4-multimodal-instruct - docs.api.nvidia.com\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4bcf86a6c669572f\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://docs.api.nvidia.com/nim/reference/microsoft-phi-4-multimodal-instruct\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"497dfa6aa73574c9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTo understand the capabilities , Phi -4- multimodal -instruct was compared with a set of models over a variety of benchmarks using an internal benchmark platform. Users can refer to the Phi-4-Mini model card for details of language benchmarks.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"497dfa6aa73574c9\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"docs.api.nvidia.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"nvidia phi-4-multimodal capabilities features 2025","provider":"duckduckgo","count":5,"tookMs":1107,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"duckduckgo","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f4e7e74875242885\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nphi-4-multimodal-instruct Model by Microsoft | NVIDIA NIM\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f4e7e74875242885\">>>","url":"https://build.nvidia.com/microsoft/phi-4-multimodal-instruct/modelcard","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"36eb642518a7f546\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nModel Quality To understand the capabilities , Phi -4- multimodal -instruct was compared with a set of models over a variety of benchmarks using an internal benchmark platform. Users can refer to the Phi-4-Mini model card for details of language benchmarks. Below is a high-level overview of the model quality on representative speech and vision ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"36eb642518a7f546\">>>","siteName":"build.nvidia.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f3d59406bb2d9b19\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nPhi-4-Mini Technical Report: Compact yet Powerful Multimodal Language ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f3d59406bb2d9b19\">>>","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.01743","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"08389f09b0183206\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nWe introduce Phi-4-Mini and Phi-4-Multimodal , compact yet highly capable language and multimodal models. Phi-4-Mini is a 3.8-billion-parameter language model trained on high-quality web and synthetic data, significantly outperforming recent open-source models of similar size and matching the performance of models twice its size on math and coding tasks requiring complex reasoning. This ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"08389f09b0183206\">>>","siteName":"arxiv.org"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"321a0cf670535bf9\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nWelcome to the new Phi-4 models - Microsoft Phi-4-mini & Phi-4-multimodal\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"321a0cf670535bf9\">>>","url":"https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/blog/educatordeveloperblog/welcome-to-the-new-phi-4-models---microsoft-phi-4-mini--phi-4-multimodal/4386037","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"cebe6212f9949cec\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nNow, let's dive into the new Phi-4-mini and Phi-4-multimodal together! Function calling This is a highly anticipated feature within the community. With function calling, Phi-4-mini and Phi-4-multimodal can extend their text-processing capabilities by integrating search engines, connecting various tools, and more.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"cebe6212f9949cec\">>>","siteName":"techcommunity.microsoft.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"dbe2e5b9d529f6e1\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nnvidia/Phi-4-multimodal-instruct-FP8 · Hugging Face\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"dbe2e5b9d529f6e1\">>>","url":"https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Phi-4-multimodal-instruct-FP8","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"283b287b5db8f113\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe NVIDIA Phi -4- multimodal -instruct FP8 model is the quantized version of Microsoft's Phi -4- multimodal -instruct model, which is a multimodal foundation model that uses an optimized transformer architecture.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"283b287b5db8f113\">>>","siteName":"huggingface.co"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"4bcf86a6c669572f\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nmicrosoft / phi-4-multimodal-instruct - docs.api.nvidia.com\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"4bcf86a6c669572f\">>>","url":"https://docs.api.nvidia.com/nim/reference/microsoft-phi-4-multimodal-instruct","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"497dfa6aa73574c9\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTo understand the capabilities , Phi -4- multimodal -instruct was compared with a set of models over a variety of benchmarks using an internal benchmark platform. Users can refer to the Phi-4-Mini model card for details of language benchmarks.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"497dfa6aa73574c9\">>>","siteName":"docs.api.nvidia.com"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776575126416}}
