{"type":"message","id":"aee15163","parentId":"7ef76fcc","timestamp":"2026-04-19T05:24:06.145Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_a26307bcdf9a4b488888f149","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"google gemma-3n-e4b-it multimodal image input output capabilities 2025\",\n  \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 1081,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"557c0967a4e19dc8\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGemma 3n model overview | Google AI for Developers\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"557c0967a4e19dc8\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/gemma-3n\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6eb4e21816daabb0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGemma 3n is a generative AI model optimized for use in everyday devices, such as phones, laptops, and tablets. This model includes innovations in parameter-efficient processing, including Per-Layer Embedding (PLE) parameter caching and a MatFormer model architecture that provides the flexibility to reduce compute and memory requirements. These models feature audio input handling, as well as ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6eb4e21816daabb0\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ai.google.dev\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7e579b1f329635d7\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\ngemma-3n-e4b-it Model by Google | NVIDIA NIM\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7e579b1f329635d7\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://build.nvidia.com/google/gemma-3n-e4b-it/modelcard\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"eed4f44ead370da2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGemma 3n e4b-it Overview Description Gemma is a family of lightweight, state-of-the-art open models from Google , built from the same research and technology used to create the Gemini models. Gemma 3n models are designed for efficient execution on low-resource devices. They are capable of multimodal input , handling text, image , video, and audio input , and generating text outputs , with open ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"eed4f44ead370da2\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"build.nvidia.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"61c6cd3040cbf445\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\ngoogle/gemma-3n-E4B · Hugging Face\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"61c6cd3040cbf445\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-3n-E4B\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e4c1c5d69e91c498\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nprint(output) # [{'input_text': '<image_soft_token> in this image , there is', # 'generated_text': '<image_soft_token> in this image , there is a beautiful flower and a bee is sucking nectar and pollen from the flower.'}]\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e4c1c5d69e91c498\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"huggingface.co\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"925a5940883c75f2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nIntroducing Gemma 3n: The developer guide- Google Developers Blog\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"925a5940883c75f2\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://developers.googleblog.com/en/introducing-gemma-3n-developer-guide/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1ec08e9fa1b87897\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMultimodal by design: Gemma 3n natively supports image , audio, video, and text inputs and text outputs . Optimized for on-device: Engineered with a focus on efficiency, Gemma 3n models are available in two sizes based on effective parameters: E2B and E4B . While their raw parameter count is 5B and 8B respectively, architectural innovations allow them to run with a memory footprint comparable to ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1ec08e9fa1b87897\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"developers.googleblog.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cb6d3cacfb9749ab\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMultimodal Understanding (Gemma 3n) | google-gemini/gemma-cookbook ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cb6d3cacfb9749ab\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://deepwiki.com/google-gemini/gemma-cookbook/2.2.2-multimodal-understanding-(gemma-3n)\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"05559102f6981a5f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThis page documents the Gemma 3n model family and its multimodal capabilities for processing image , audio, and video inputs alongside text. Gemma 3n models are optimized for edge devices such as phones, laptops, and tablets, using a nested MatFormer architecture that enables efficient on-device inference.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"05559102f6981a5f\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"deepwiki.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"google gemma-3n-e4b-it multimodal image input output capabilities 2025","provider":"duckduckgo","count":5,"tookMs":1081,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"duckduckgo","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"557c0967a4e19dc8\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nGemma 3n model overview | Google AI for Developers\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"557c0967a4e19dc8\">>>","url":"https://ai.google.dev/gemma/docs/gemma-3n","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6eb4e21816daabb0\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nGemma 3n is a generative AI model optimized for use in everyday devices, such as phones, laptops, and tablets. This model includes innovations in parameter-efficient processing, including Per-Layer Embedding (PLE) parameter caching and a MatFormer model architecture that provides the flexibility to reduce compute and memory requirements. These models feature audio input handling, as well as ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6eb4e21816daabb0\">>>","siteName":"ai.google.dev"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7e579b1f329635d7\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\ngemma-3n-e4b-it Model by Google | NVIDIA NIM\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7e579b1f329635d7\">>>","url":"https://build.nvidia.com/google/gemma-3n-e4b-it/modelcard","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"eed4f44ead370da2\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nGemma 3n e4b-it Overview Description Gemma is a family of lightweight, state-of-the-art open models from Google , built from the same research and technology used to create the Gemini models. Gemma 3n models are designed for efficient execution on low-resource devices. They are capable of multimodal input , handling text, image , video, and audio input , and generating text outputs , with open ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"eed4f44ead370da2\">>>","siteName":"build.nvidia.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"61c6cd3040cbf445\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\ngoogle/gemma-3n-E4B · Hugging Face\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"61c6cd3040cbf445\">>>","url":"https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-3n-E4B","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e4c1c5d69e91c498\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nprint(output) # [{'input_text': '<image_soft_token> in this image , there is', # 'generated_text': '<image_soft_token> in this image , there is a beautiful flower and a bee is sucking nectar and pollen from the flower.'}]\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e4c1c5d69e91c498\">>>","siteName":"huggingface.co"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"925a5940883c75f2\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nIntroducing Gemma 3n: The developer guide- Google Developers Blog\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"925a5940883c75f2\">>>","url":"https://developers.googleblog.com/en/introducing-gemma-3n-developer-guide/","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1ec08e9fa1b87897\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMultimodal by design: Gemma 3n natively supports image , audio, video, and text inputs and text outputs . Optimized for on-device: Engineered with a focus on efficiency, Gemma 3n models are available in two sizes based on effective parameters: E2B and E4B . While their raw parameter count is 5B and 8B respectively, architectural innovations allow them to run with a memory footprint comparable to ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1ec08e9fa1b87897\">>>","siteName":"developers.googleblog.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"cb6d3cacfb9749ab\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMultimodal Understanding (Gemma 3n) | google-gemini/gemma-cookbook ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"cb6d3cacfb9749ab\">>>","url":"https://deepwiki.com/google-gemini/gemma-cookbook/2.2.2-multimodal-understanding-(gemma-3n)","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"05559102f6981a5f\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThis page documents the Gemma 3n model family and its multimodal capabilities for processing image , audio, and video inputs alongside text. Gemma 3n models are optimized for edge devices such as phones, laptops, and tablets, using a nested MatFormer architecture that enables efficient on-device inference.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"05559102f6981a5f\">>>","siteName":"deepwiki.com"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776576246143}}
{"type":"message","id":"cc21d3cd","parentId":"aee15163","timestamp":"2026-04-19T05:24:22.716Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"根据搜索结果，Gemma 3N 的能力很清晰了。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"根据官方资料：\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 Google Gemma 3N E4B IT 能力\n\n| 能力 | 支持情况 |\n|------|----------|\n| **🖼️ 图像输入** | ✅ 支持 |\n| **🎬 视频输入** | ✅ 支持 |\n| **🎵 音频输入** | ✅ 支持 |\n| **📝 文本输入** | ✅ 支持 |\n| **🖼️ 图像输出** | ❌ 不支持 |\n| **📝 文本输出** | ✅ 支持 |\n\n---\n\n## 详细说明\n\n**输入**：可以同时接收图像、视频、音频、文本\n- 分析图片内容、生成描述\n- 理解视频场景\n- 处理音频（语音、音乐）\n\n**输出**：仅文本\n- 只能生成文字回答\n- 不能生成图片/视频/音频\n\n---\n\n## 对比：图像输出模型\n\n如果需要**图像生成**，可以用这些：\n\n| 模型 | 能力 |\n|------|------|\n| `nvidia/nv-embed-v1` | 文本嵌入 |\n| `google/lyria-3-pro-preview` | 音乐生成 🎵 |\n| OpenClaw 图生图 | 依赖其他 provider |\n\n目前你配置的这个 Gemma 3N 是**输入型多模态**（理解分析），不是**输出型**（生成图像）。\n\n需要测试 Gemma 3N 分析图片的能力吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"minimax-m2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776576246147,"responseId":"0217765762463675dc9aa6c4e6a4204292e30580ff3cb0eefc461"}}
