{"type":"message","id":"67f25e66","parentId":"5cc3c37d","timestamp":"2026-04-19T05:56:59.552Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_1baaab6394814ed9ae63eeae","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The image is a close-up of a document with a bright yellow background. The text on the document is black, and some of it is highlighted in green. The text appears to be a list of job roles or tools, divided into three main sections.\n\nThe top section has a green-highlighted title: \"4-deep-research (多来源综合深度研究)\".\n\nThe second section, titled \"二、开发工作\" (Development Work) in black, also has green-highlighted sub-items:\n1.  \"product-spec-builder (毒蛇产品经理)\"\n2.  \"ui-prompt-generator (UI提示词设计师)\"\n3.  \"ui-ux-pro-max (UI/UX设计智能)\"\n4.  \"dev-builder (全栈开发工程师)\"\n\nThe third section, titled \"三、文字工作\" (Text Work) in black, also has green-highlighted sub-items:\n1.  \"brainstorming (九步探索头脑风暴)\"\n2.  \"minimax-docx、pdf、xlsx (加强版办公三件套)\"\n3.  \"ppt-generator (专业的PPT设计)\"\n4.  \"humanizer-zh (去除AI写作痕迹)\"\n\nThe text is in a sans-serif font. The overall presentation is clear and organized, suggesting it's a list of functionalities or job descriptions related to AI or technology."}],"details":{"model":"google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite","image":"/home/node/.openclaw/media/inbound/2f4f430a-ee52-4f32-b0ee-ce90e9025585.jpg","attempts":[{"provider":"nvidia","model":"google/gemma-3n-e4b-it","error":"Unknown model: nvidia/google/gemma-3n-e4b-it | Unknown model: nvidia/google/gemma-3n-e4b-it"},{"provider":"openai","model":"gpt-5.4-mini","error":"Image model failed (openai/gpt-5.4-mini): You exceeded your current quota, please check your plan and billing details. For more information on this error, read the docs: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/error-codes/api-errors. | Image model failed (openai/gpt-5.4-mini): You exceeded your current quota, please check your plan and billing details. For more information on this error, read the docs: https://platform.ope