{"type":"message","id":"c9c64206","parentId":"67f25e66","timestamp":"2026-04-19T05:57:12.206Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"成功用 Gemma 3N 分析了图片内容！这是一个中文文档，描述了一些 AI 工具或功能。让我给用户总结一下。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"✅ **Gemma 3N 图像识别测试成功！**\n\n---\n\n## 📄 图片内容提取\n\n这是一份**中文文档**，看起来是某个 AI 工具/系统的功能列表：\n\n### 一深度研究 (Deep Research)\n- **4-deep-research** - 多来源综合深度研究\n\n### 二、开发工作 (Development Work)\n1. product-spec-builder - 毒蛇产品经理\n2. ui-prompt-generator - UI提示词设计师\n3. ui-ux-pro-max - UI/UX设计智能\n4. dev-builder - 全栈开发工程师\n\n### 三、文字工作 (Text Work)\n1. brainstorming - 九步探索头脑风暴\n2. minimax-docx、pdf、xlsx - 加强版办公三件套\n3. ppt-generator - 专业的PPT设计\n4. humanizer-zh - 去除AI写作痕迹\n\n---\n\n**结论**：Gemma 3N 图像输入功能正常 ✅\n- 可以识别图片中的文字（OCR 能力）\n- 支持中文识别\n- 能理解文档结构并总结\n\n这应该是 EchoNexus 的设计文档吧？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"minimax-m2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776578219554,"responseId":"0217765782197765dc9aa6c4e6a4204292e30580ff3cb0e96d0ec"}}
